B.aFz=new A.amP("Sesiones de Qobuz","Qobuz entrega FLAC solo con una cuenta con suscripci\xf3n. La app baja esas sesiones de una fuente tuya (el /pool de tu Worker) y las rota sola; ac\xe1 ves si la fuente est\xe1 viva.","Con sesiones","Fuente ca\xedda","Sin sesiones","Sin configurar","Consultando\u2026","No se pudo consultar","El pool tiene credenciales vivas: la descarga directa de Qobuz funciona.","Ninguna fuente respondi\xf3: revis\xe1 la URL y que el endpoint est\xe9 publicado.","La fuente respondi\xf3 pero no public\xf3 sesiones vivas: revis\xe1 que tenga tokens de una cuenta con suscripci\xf3n.","No hay ninguna URL de pool configurada.","No se pudo consultar el estado del pool. Prob\xe1 de nuevo.","URL del pool (opcional)","https://tu-worker.workers.dev/pool/<secreto>","Una sola URL. Si la dej\xe1s vac\xeda se usa el origen de f\xe1brica. Pon\xe9 el secreto en la ruta si tu Worker lo pide.",u.b,"Guardado","Revisar estado","Revisando\u2026","Tu cuenta de Qobuz (opcional)","Correo de Qobuz","tu@correo.com","Contrase\xf1a","Tu contrase\xf1a de Qobuz","Con tu propia cuenta, la app inicia sesi\xf3n sola y baja el FLAC directo de Qobuz, sin depender del pool. La sesi\xf3n se guarda y se renueva sola; la contrase\xf1a queda solo en este dispositivo.","Complet\xe1 correo y contrase\xf1a (el correo tiene que tener @), o dej\xe1 los dos campos vac\xedos para usar el pool.","Conectar y probar","Conectando\u2026")
B.aFA=new A.amP("Qobuz sessions","Qobuz only hands over FLAC with a subscription account. The app downloads those sessions from a source of yours (your Worker /pool) and rotates them by itself; here you see whether the source is alive.","Has sessions","Source down","No sessions","Not set up","Checking\u2026","Could not check","The pool has live credentials: Qobuz direct download works.","No source answered: check the URL and that the endpoint is deployed.","The source answered but published no live sessions: check that it has tokens from a subscription account.","No pool URL is configured.","Could not check the pool status. Try again.","Pool URL (optional)","https://your-worker.workers.dev/pool/<secret>","A single URL. Leave it empty to use the factory origin. Put the secret in the path if your Worker asks for one.",u.v,"Saved","Check status","Checking\u2026","Your Qobuz account (optional)","Qobuz email","you@email.com","Password","Your Qobuz password","With your own account the app signs in by itself and pulls FLAC straight from Qobuz, without relying on the pool. The session is stored and renewed on its own; the password stays on this device only.","Fill in both email and password (the email must contain @), or leave both empty to use the pool.","Connect and test","Connecting\u2026")
